<title>HONG KONG: Pac Plywood amends bonus warrant issue.</title>
<headline>Pac Plywood amends bonus warrant issue.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pacific Plywood Holdings Ltd amended its proposed bonus warrants issue, the company said on Tuesday in a statement issued through the stock exchange.</p>
<p>Pacific Plywood proposed to issue one bonus warrant for every 20 shares held, instead of the initial one bonus warrant for every four shares, the company said.</p>
<p>One warrant entitles the holder to subscribe for one share and the period of the warrants is 18 months commencing from the date of its issue.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
